    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where h l − 1 − h l = ∆ h + l − ∆ h − l , ∆ h + l , ∆ h − l ≥ 0, The finite element with switch detection (FESD) algorithm was implemented as a package NOSNOC in [19]."
  }, {
