    "bounding box" : [ 305.051, 570.264, 558.333, 595.223 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "We define the set of finite elements which have the switching point at the end (i.e. right) as:"
